* [**Updated**] [Atmosphere 1.12.1](https://github.com/rashevskyv/Kefirosphere) — Update to the official Atmosphère 1.12.1 release:
    * Added support for firmware 23.0.1.
    * [**loader / mesosphere**] Redesigned the memory patches for the web applets. The browser, eShop and offline browser now see 1 GB of free memory, and the browser engine heap is reduced. This fixes crashes during video playback in eShop and in games that use LibAppletOff. System modules again get 40 MB of extra memory instead of 16 MB.
